---
// OwnershipVsMobilityTable.astro
---

<div class="my-12 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-3xl mx-auto">
  
  <div class="px-6 py-5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-semibold mb-1">Illustration 2</div>
    <h3 class="text-lg text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium m-0">Ownership is Not Mobility</h3>
  </div>

  <div class="p-0">
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr class="bg-slate-100 dark:bg-slate-800/80 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800">
            <th class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 w-1/3">Dimension</th>
            <th class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 w-2/3">The Economic Question</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-200 dark:divide-slate-800/50">
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200">Ownership</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Who legally owns the wealth?</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-medium text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-200">Use</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">What may the owner do with it inside India?</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">Convertibility</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Can it be converted into foreign currency?</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-medium text-indigo-700 dark:text-indigo-400">Repatriability</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">Can its value be transferred outside India?</td>
          </tr>
          <tr class="hover:bg-slate-50 dark:hover:bg-slate-800/30 transition-colors bg-amber-50/30 dark:bg-amber-900/10">
            <td class="py-4 px-6 font-medium text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-500">Velocity</td>
            <td class="py-4 px-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">How quickly can that transfer occur? <span class="text-xs ml-2 text-slate-400 dark:text-slate-500 font-mono bg-white dark:bg-slate-900 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-700">(The 1M Limit)</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    
    <div class="px-6 py-4 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/50 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800/80 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
      <strong class="text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-300">The important insight:</strong> a sovereign can recognise full ownership while placing strict conditions on cross-border mobility.
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
